<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-chenshu" book-id="b-chenshu-007" chapter-id="c-chenshu-007-wang-empress-and-zhize" source-id="s-chenshu-007-wang-empress-and-zhize-ws2015446">
  <p id="c-chenshu-007-wang-empress-and-zhize:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">廢帝<persName id="c-chenshu-007-wang-empress-and-zhize:p001:m0002" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAEB">王皇后</persName>，金紫光祿大夫<persName id="c-chenshu-007-wang-empress-and-zhize:p001:m0012" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAE">固</persName>之女也。天嘉元年，為皇太子妃，廢帝即位，立為皇后。廢帝為臨海王，后為臨海王妃。至德中薨。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-007-wang-empress-and-zhize:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">后生臨海嗣王<persName id="c-chenshu-007-wang-empress-and-zhize:p002:m0006" ref="2mj_6rl_6xs_A">至澤</persName>。<persName id="c-chenshu-007-wang-empress-and-zhize:p002:m0009" ref="2mj_6rl_6xs_A">至澤</persName>以光大元年為皇太子。太建元年，襲封臨海嗣王。尋為宣惠將軍，置佐史。陳亡入長安。</p>
</text>
